# Space starts a game, and P pauses it, resumes it and pauses it again. The
# title screen changes every frame, and a stopped program leaves the console
# cursor blinking every 30 frames, so an expect-same over exactly 30 frames
# passes only on a paused game.
run 30
press space
run 2
release space
run 20
press p
run 2
release p
run 5
mark
run 30
expect-same
press p
run 2
release p
run 5
expect-changed
press p
run 2
release p
run 5
mark
run 30
expect-same
